0register%20tracking%20decouples%20parcel%20sort%20decisions%20from%20conveyor%20speed%20variations%2C%20ensuring%20zero%20misplaced%20packages.%3C%2Ftext%3E%0A%20%20%3C%2Fg%3E%0A%3C%2Fsvg%3E",
